{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830870/extras/239f0602c4d6989fd7a7c183e5a8e1a7.avif?t=1764244241\" width=286 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brace for impact as you learn to ski with physics! Keep your balance in check or hit the frozen slopes <strong>face first!\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The vast and beautiful scenery holds many dangers will put even the most seasoned skier to the test.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830870/extras/a19910e30a7a8c3a0f1cb66564da03af.avif?t=1764244241\" width=299 height=33 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830870/extras/f97b7edefa2a55a777d65cc19cd038e6.webp?t=1764244241\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830870/extras/f97b7edefa2a55a777d65cc19cd038e6.poster.webp?t=1764244241\" class=\"bb_img\" width=550 height=209 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver pizzas, parcels, letters and even furniture - <i>in one piece</i> if you want a tip! <br>Perform flips  to impress the Peak's demanding inhabitants\u00a0for bonus tips and unlockable items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830870/extras/6ff1656f1a4693e3c19d25737a38d42e.avif?t=1764244241\" width=250 height=33 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830870/extras/e823a915d64291a6327fcbbb3909e858.avif?t=1764244241\" width=550 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_para